      <description align="center" color="red" colored="true" height="611" resized="true" width="356" x="34" y="38">Prepare Optimizer Parameters&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;This block filters tags from the model_tag table with flag_parameter set to 1, identifying them as parameters. It then extracts all tags from constraint equations and removes those already marked as variables. The remaining tags are added to the parameter list to ensure a complete and accurate configuration for the Gekko optimizer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inputs:&lt;br&gt;1: actual data&lt;br&gt;2:variables&lt;br&gt;3: consraints&lt;br&gt;4:objectives&lt;br&gt;5:model_tag&lt;br&gt;6:model status&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Output:&lt;br/&gt;1. Parameters&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <description align="center" color="blue" colored="true" height="610" resized="true" width="319" x="396" y="38">Main</description>
      <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="105" resized="false" width="180" x="486" y="380">O/P: Parameters</description>
